      "paperId": "772c8b6ea40574b51fecae3e45061263bf488cfc",
      "title": "Reimagining Social Theory, Community-Based Philosophy, Confronting the Colonial Legacy, and Collective Healing Through Art: Vibrations of Absence",
      "authors": [
